# vulkan-game: two-file rewrite (foundation)

Only `server.cpp` and `client.cpp` are compiled as application sources.
No `srv/`, `clt/`, `weapons.cpp` or `weapons.hpp` directories/files remain
in this branch. The old shaders (`shd/`) are retained for a future renderer.

The server and client currently implement authenticated DTLS transport,
reliable scene/movement messages, simple cube scene replication, basic
movement prediction and correction, and ammo/reloading. The client is
headless: **this branch does not preserve the old renderer, model import,
weapon animations or editor. It is not a release-ready replacement.**

Source repositories are Git submodules: `vulkan-wrapper`, `vulkan-systems`,
and `vulkan-headers`. The Vulkan headers and Mbed TLS remain indirect build
dependencies. There is no GLFW, fastgltf, Ozz, or stb in the app build.

```
git submodule update --init --recursive
c build vulkan-server
c build vulkan-client
c build run vulkan-server
c build run vulkan-client -- 127.0.0.1 27015
```

On the client, type `w`, `a`, `s`, `d`, `stop`, `f`, `r`, or `exit` and Enter.
The original server/client source layout is preserved on the main branch.